{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>Erase me now from Your book.</b> One cannot say this means the book of the Torah, for it had not yet been written. Rather, what is 'Your book'? The book of the living, in which human beings are inscribed on Rosh HaShanah, as stated in tractate Rosh HaShanah. <b>Your book</b> — these are the intermediate ones. <b>That You have written</b> — these are the righteous."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:35.923373749Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}